  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed single storey rear extension by reason of its position, size, design and appearance, would be intrusive alterations, causing loss of light and outlook to neighbours, and appear out of scale and character with this and neighbouring dwellings, as well as having an adverse effect on the visual amenities of the locality. Thus, it is contrary to Local Plan Policies SC7, CC1 and CC2 and the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal fails to demonstrate that the plant equipment generates noise levels at least 10dB below background noise levels. The development therefore fails to demonstrate that there would be no harm to residential neighbours' living conditions and is contrary to Local Plan Policies EQ5 and SC7 and the National Planning Policy Framework. "
